no stage
7000 4 postgres://flag/shop 7
port      7000                    env  SHOP__PORT
host      "localhost"             default
db.url    "postgres://flag/shop"  flag  --db.url
db.pool   4                       file  <dir>/app.toml
password  <secret>                env  SHOP__PASSWORD
port was also set by file <dir>/app.toml, which a later source replaced
db.url was also set by file <dir>/app.toml, which a later source replaced

prod
7000 40 postgres://flag/shop 7
port      7000                    env  SHOP__PORT
host      "localhost"             default
db.url    "postgres://flag/shop"  flag  --db.url
db.pool   40                      file  <dir>/app.prod.toml (stage prod)
password  <secret>                env  SHOP__PASSWORD
db.pool was also set by file <dir>/app.toml, which a later source replaced
port was also set by file <dir>/app.toml, which a later source replaced
db.url was also set by file <dir>/app.toml, which a later source replaced

staging
  (value)  names the stage staging, and the config declares prod  config.unknown_stage
